WEBVTT

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.491
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:27.427
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.663
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:32.866
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:38.772
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:43.376
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:55.121
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.121 --> 00:01:00.861
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.861 --> 00:01:06.533
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:12.205
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:17.377
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:30.745
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:35.228
All the various drink dispensers are suspect.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.229
Damn!

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:42.402
Anybody not drink
anything in the last three days?

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:47.774
Amanda and I were in
confined cells the whole time.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:51.978
Ah, so that's why you seem fine.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:55.148
- Sorry...
- Nothing to apologize about.

00:01:55.148 --> 00:02:00.153
In fact, this means we get to
show what we're made of one last time.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.588
What are you going to do?

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:02.956
Nothing special.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:07.160
We're going to protect people
from Amalgams, just like always.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.186
That is what XAT does.

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:17.103
You're still human.
So we're going to protect you.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:18.805
Even if it costs our lives.

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:21.908
Don't be stupid! We're in XAT too, you know!

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.643
We'll fight to the end together!

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.278
Listen, Hermann.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:28.782
No matter how hard we
struggle, we can't be saved now.

00:02:28.782 --> 00:02:32.886
But no way in hell am
I letting Wolf get off scott-free.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.854
Brad...

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.190
The moment we're able to protect someone,

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.894
our fight will finally end,
with our mission accomplished.

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:44.931
So, Amanda. Hermann.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:51.972
You have to survive. I want to
accomplish this mission completely.

00:02:51.972 --> 00:02:54.374
Guys...

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:58.211
We know. You don't hafta say it.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:02.549
So there you have it, Missy.
We have one last job for you.

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:06.052
Find us the best route
from here to the heliport.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:09.189
Right. I'm sending it to your terminal.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:13.693
Thanks! I've got it!

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:17.664
All hands, take all the weapons
and ammunition you can carry!

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:20.360
No need to be stingy!

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:34.014
Clavier to Control.

00:03:34.014 --> 00:03:37.217
Captain Wolf. Please respond.

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.152
Wolf here.

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:42.022
Currently transmitting on emergency line.

00:03:42.022 --> 00:03:44.457
Has Squad 3 returned to base?

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:48.795
Only Senger and I. The rest
are confirming the scene.

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:52.162
Captain Wolf. What in
the world happened at HQ?!

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:08.948
Al!

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:11.518
Don't get blood on you by accident!

00:04:11.518 --> 00:04:15.722
After all this, we can't
have you guys getting infected!

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:16.289
Al!

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:19.225
Whoa! Don't touch me! I don't need treatment.

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:20.260
But...!

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.956
My blood is dangerous too, now...

00:04:25.131 --> 00:04:26.199
Al...

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:30.236
It does hurt a little, but I'm strangely okay...

00:04:30.236 --> 00:04:34.274
Guess this is finally, "Goodbye, humanity."

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:35.375
Quit being stupid!

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:40.213
Hurry! Let's get us some
distance before the next ones come!

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:43.516
If you encounter anyone
but me, stop them immediately!

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:46.853
All of Squad 1 and Squad 2 have been infected!

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:50.023
Don't be fooled by friends
you had until yesterday!

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:52.058
They're all infected?

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:56.229
Yes. They're all Amalgams now.

00:04:56.229 --> 00:05:00.733
Don't let them fool you,
no matter what form they take.

00:05:00.733 --> 00:05:01.801
Roger.

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:06.465
You heard the situation. Let's
hurry to the heliborne section, Kurz!

00:05:11.678 --> 00:05:13.179
Sir!

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:15.977
- Th-The gun! My hand...!
- Are you all right?!

00:05:29.129 --> 00:05:32.198
- Damn it...
- It's over! We're finished!

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:33.366
Shut the hell up!

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:37.496
If you got time to be a pessimist,
then shoot that bastard Wolf...

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:52.214
Now do you see? There's no
escape for us, even in death.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.224
Oh? Seems you've gotten a little better.

00:05:58.224 --> 00:06:03.830
You have so much power,
so why do you bother helping humans?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:07.664
They never thank you,
and all they do is loathe you...

00:06:15.008 --> 00:06:18.739
Don't get cocky, you piece of scum!

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:31.524
To be honest, you're a real eyesore!

00:06:31.524 --> 00:06:33.826
Alright! It's a straight run from here!

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:35.628
Just keep your distance from them!

00:06:35.628 --> 00:06:37.858
Welp...

00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:44.170
Sorry, but I shouldn't go any further...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.138
Al?

00:06:45.138 --> 00:06:47.140
What's wrong?! Hey, Al!

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:50.677
Is that you, Hermann?

00:06:50.677 --> 00:06:54.547
Sorry. I can't really tell anymore...

00:06:54.547 --> 00:06:58.551
Everything that moves
looks like a monster to me now...

00:06:58.551 --> 00:07:01.554
I can't tell who's friend
and who's enemy anymore...

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:02.722
Oh no...

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:06.859
If I go with you, I'll just
wind up shooting you in the back.

00:07:06.859 --> 00:07:12.031
So I'll keep guard here
and shoot everyone who comes!

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:15.468
No need to hold back on a solo job, after all...

00:07:15.468 --> 00:07:18.571
Al... I'm sorry we're the only ones who...

00:07:18.571 --> 00:07:20.974
We didn't get wiped out.

00:07:20.974 --> 00:07:23.943
That simple fact means we won.

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.779
Whatever happens,
you two have to live through this.

00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:29.582
It all comes down to you in the end.

00:07:29.582 --> 00:07:30.316
Al...

00:07:30.316 --> 00:07:32.485
Now get going.

00:07:32.485 --> 00:07:37.490
Honestly, I don't want anyone
to see what happens to me next...

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.014
Sorry!

00:07:41.394 --> 00:07:43.763
Hold 'em off for just five minutes.

00:07:43.763 --> 00:07:49.168
Let's meet up after that. I'll be waiting.

00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:53.400
Guess I'll just have to say,
"Roger!" for now, partner...

00:07:54.974 --> 00:07:56.843
Hey, Brad...

00:07:56.843 --> 00:07:59.012
If you wind up being reincarnated...

00:07:59.012 --> 00:08:02.348
...make it someone who's
a smoother talker, will ya?

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:05.952
You let so many chances go by, y'know that?

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:09.581
Yeah. You're probably right.

00:08:15.128 --> 00:08:22.535
Damn... Not feeling
pain is an even worse omen...

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:27.029
My tough manliness
is going to waste like this...

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:35.439
OK, brothers! It's time to go all out!

00:09:10.483 --> 00:09:12.352
That's right.

00:09:12.352 --> 00:09:16.522
In the end, that's the extent of your power...

00:09:16.522 --> 00:09:18.854
What are you doing, Beatrice?

00:09:20.626 --> 00:09:21.928
Xargin-sama!

00:09:21.928 --> 00:09:24.864
Is this really the time for games?

00:09:24.864 --> 00:09:28.634
I do believe I gave you an even
more important duty to perform.

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:31.603
I-I'm very sorry!

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.877
So we meet again, and you're still alive.

00:09:37.877 --> 00:09:39.812
X-Xargin...

00:09:39.812 --> 00:09:41.381
Very well, Joseph.

00:09:41.381 --> 00:09:46.614
I acknowledge that your body
exists alongside divine providence.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.900
Is the mission finally over now?

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:04.537
Yeah. All that's left is to take off!

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:06.472
You're...!

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:09.575
Get going! Just forget about us!

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:10.643
But...!

00:10:10.643 --> 00:10:13.279
Mei-Fong should be...

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:15.314
What the...?!

00:10:15.314 --> 00:10:16.549
Freeze!

00:10:16.549 --> 00:10:19.118
A Squad 3 Paladin?! What is it doing here?

00:10:19.118 --> 00:10:22.021
Sorry, but this place is humans-only!

00:10:22.021 --> 00:10:24.257
We can't let you go any further!

00:10:24.257 --> 00:10:27.927
Where's Mei-Fong?! Our unit's
operator secured a helicopter for us!

00:10:27.927 --> 00:10:31.624
So sorry, but we're the only ones here!

00:10:36.002 --> 00:10:38.671
Brad. So you really are...?

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:39.572
Lene?!

00:10:39.572 --> 00:10:43.709
Lene! What are you doing?!
They're Amalgams now! Fire!

00:10:43.709 --> 00:10:46.212
Wait! There are still humans here!

00:10:46.212 --> 00:10:49.115
You idiot! Don't be
fooled by their appearances!

00:10:49.115 --> 00:10:50.783
Don't you remember Captain Wolf's orders?!

00:10:50.783 --> 00:10:53.352
Wolf?! Don't tell me that bastard...!

00:10:53.352 --> 00:10:58.057
Lene! We're protecting
survivors from the department!

00:10:58.057 --> 00:11:02.028
Brad... You still know who I am...

00:11:02.028 --> 00:11:05.798
Yeah. But it's only a matter of time.

00:11:05.798 --> 00:11:08.301
These are the only two who made it out fine.

00:11:08.301 --> 00:11:10.236
Take them and fly out of here!

00:11:10.236 --> 00:11:15.374
As if we can believe you!
We've already fallen for that trick once!

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:19.178
It's true that the two in the
back don't show signs of infection...

00:11:19.178 --> 00:11:22.448
Y-You idiot! Are you going
to let 'em fool you that easily?!

00:11:22.448 --> 00:11:28.888
We're not here to suspect everyone!
We're here to rescue survivors!

00:11:28.888 --> 00:11:31.049
- Get back!
- Kurz! Stop!

00:11:34.327 --> 00:11:35.428
Did I get 'em?!

00:11:35.428 --> 00:11:38.522
Kurz! What the hell are you doing?!

00:11:41.968 --> 00:11:44.604
You idiot! Behind you!

00:11:44.604 --> 00:11:46.265
Kurz!

00:11:49.709 --> 00:11:53.279
Wolf! Damn you!

00:11:53.279 --> 00:11:58.518
Well, Brad? How does it feel
to be shot by a former comrade?

00:11:58.518 --> 00:12:03.923
Now do you get it? You
have no place to go back to now.

00:12:03.923 --> 00:12:07.593
Brad, no matter how hard you try to be human,

00:12:07.593 --> 00:12:10.229
no other humans will allow it.

00:12:10.229 --> 00:12:14.000
Once you've been infected,
being killed is all you can hope for.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.137
So we've been fooled completely?!

00:12:18.137 --> 00:12:19.972
Get lost, woman.

00:12:19.972 --> 00:12:22.775
You two, get in the chopper!

00:12:22.775 --> 00:12:24.544
I'll take care of Brad!

00:12:24.544 --> 00:12:26.178
Lene, I'm already...

00:12:26.178 --> 00:12:30.883
No giving up! You're a
member of XAT! Show some guts!

00:12:30.883 --> 00:12:33.286
No, Lene! It's too dangerous!

00:12:33.286 --> 00:12:35.187
I'll be fine!

00:12:35.187 --> 00:12:38.691
I can't be infected, thanks to
the Paladin's biochemical shielding!

00:12:38.691 --> 00:12:41.894
No matter what, I'm taking you
to a facility that can keep you safe!

00:12:41.894 --> 00:12:43.462
- Hurry, Amanda!
- But...!

00:12:43.462 --> 00:12:46.132
What can we possibly do
by standing around here?!

00:12:46.132 --> 00:12:47.433
Hurry! Get going!

00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:49.025
Let's go! Run!

00:12:50.903 --> 00:12:55.107
Your fight is with us, Wolf!

00:12:55.107 --> 00:12:56.742
Get going, Hermann!

00:12:56.742 --> 00:12:59.111
I'm taking off! Amanda!

00:12:59.111 --> 00:13:01.781
I will protect Amanda!

00:13:08.654 --> 00:13:10.056
Amanda! Wait!

00:13:10.056 --> 00:13:13.651
We can't just abandon them!
Get us closer, Hermann!

00:13:15.595 --> 00:13:17.964
Annoying pest!

00:13:17.964 --> 00:13:21.033
No, you don't!

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:23.669
Die!

00:13:23.669 --> 00:13:29.108
I told you to watch out for Amalgams.

00:13:29.108 --> 00:13:32.168
No way! Why isn't it electrified?!

00:13:33.379 --> 00:13:36.415
Fool! I took pre-emptive measures!

00:13:36.415 --> 00:13:38.184
Eject! Lene!

00:13:38.184 --> 00:13:44.523
Unable to control! Ejecting!

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:49.862
I won't kill you. Or will you
bite your tongue off as a way to die?

00:13:49.862 --> 00:13:52.698
See? Aren't humans pathetic?!

00:13:52.698 --> 00:13:55.167
They can't even take their own lives,

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:57.637
just because they
believe in some half-assed god!

00:13:57.637 --> 00:13:59.672
Wolf! Damn you!

00:13:59.672 --> 00:14:02.074
Stop!

00:14:02.074 --> 00:14:03.976
Brad! Shoot!

00:14:03.976 --> 00:14:07.380
- Damn it!
- Don't worry about me! Shoot!

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:09.215
Hermann! Open the hatch!

00:14:09.215 --> 00:14:09.982
What?!

00:14:09.982 --> 00:14:11.283
Amanda! What are you doing?!

00:14:11.283 --> 00:14:12.652
Taking a Paladin out!

00:14:12.652 --> 00:14:15.254
Are you insane?! You can't just
suddenly pilot it without training!

00:14:15.254 --> 00:14:19.125
With the automated commands,
I can at least offer backup!

00:14:19.125 --> 00:14:20.292
Shoot! Brad!

00:14:20.292 --> 00:14:23.029
Shoot me yourself! Please!

00:14:23.029 --> 00:14:24.664
Listen to the girl!

00:14:24.664 --> 00:14:28.834
Give it a shot! Become
a full monster and kill someone!

00:14:28.834 --> 00:14:31.137
I bet you'll change your attitude then!

00:14:31.137 --> 00:14:32.798
Wolf!

00:14:35.074 --> 00:14:37.009
Brad!

00:14:37.009 --> 00:14:38.678
Weak man!

00:14:38.678 --> 00:14:41.579
You want to save her that badly?

00:14:44.016 --> 00:14:46.218
Go... Hermann...

00:14:46.218 --> 00:14:48.788
Go! Forget about us!

00:14:48.788 --> 00:14:53.192
Open the hatch, Hermann!
I'll go back alone if I have to!

00:14:53.192 --> 00:14:54.894
Brad! I'm sorry!

00:14:54.894 --> 00:14:57.124
No! Hermann!

00:14:59.765 --> 00:15:01.901
How nice it is you care for your friends!

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:05.564
Okay, in that case, how
does this strike your fancy?

00:15:07.039 --> 00:15:10.643
Go back! Please! Hermann!
It's not too late yet!

00:15:10.643 --> 00:15:16.482
Amanda, don't you understand how they feel?

00:15:16.482 --> 00:15:18.143
Hermann!

00:15:24.657 --> 00:15:26.386
Lene!

00:15:29.729 --> 00:15:34.266
For you and me, this heat is nothing at all.

00:15:34.266 --> 00:15:36.869
But it's a living hell for her.

00:15:36.869 --> 00:15:39.371
This is the difference between them and us.

00:15:39.371 --> 00:15:42.074
Now, then. How long until she dies?

00:15:42.074 --> 00:15:44.577
Wolf! Damn you!

00:15:44.577 --> 00:15:47.413
You can save her very easily, Brad.

00:15:47.413 --> 00:15:51.817
Spill some of your blood on her right now.

00:15:51.817 --> 00:15:54.820
You two lovebirds can
give up your humanity together.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.088
Damn it!

00:15:56.088 --> 00:15:58.257
There's no time to hesitate, Brad.

00:15:58.257 --> 00:16:05.197
It might seem cruel, but there's
no other way she can be saved now.

00:16:05.197 --> 00:16:07.392
Brad...

00:16:08.768 --> 00:16:13.105
Brad... Brad...

00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:16.542
Lene is way too reckless.

00:16:16.542 --> 00:16:20.546
When it comes to supporting
you, she loses all common sense.

00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:22.348
XAT, huh?

00:16:22.348 --> 00:16:25.151
Are you unhappy with us in some way?

00:16:25.151 --> 00:16:28.921
No, sir. It is entirely for personal reasons.

00:16:28.921 --> 00:16:33.392
I thought I would get you killed someday...

00:16:33.392 --> 00:16:38.230
That scared me more
than anything else. And yet...

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:41.267
Why're you bringing this up now, you idiot?

00:16:41.267 --> 00:16:46.034
My life has always been in
your hands from the very start!

00:16:51.177 --> 00:16:53.078
Say...

00:16:53.078 --> 00:16:57.447
Could you give my bullet back?

00:17:05.591 --> 00:17:08.754
Goodbye, Lene...

00:17:19.672 --> 00:17:20.906
How foolish!

00:17:20.906 --> 00:17:23.409
You're the fool, Wolf!

00:17:23.409 --> 00:17:27.847
Just what salvation is there,
now that I've been turned into this?!

00:17:27.847 --> 00:17:29.215
How dare you...

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:32.718
How dare you do this to us and our comrades!

00:17:32.718 --> 00:17:34.049
Be quiet!

00:17:38.591 --> 00:17:40.957
Now, Brad!

00:17:56.308 --> 00:18:03.115
Brad... Hey... Did we take Wolf down?

00:18:03.115 --> 00:18:09.822
No... My shots didn't fly true...

00:18:09.822 --> 00:18:13.225
Mine either... This sure sucks...

00:18:13.225 --> 00:18:16.395
Even so, we've still won...

00:18:16.395 --> 00:18:18.564
Yeah, that's true...

00:18:18.564 --> 00:18:22.468
Oh well... I was always
prepared to die in the line of duty...

00:18:22.468 --> 00:18:27.072
You fools. You're going to
die like dogs, and nothing more!

00:18:27.072 --> 00:18:37.950
No, we're going to die proudly,
fighting as members of XAT...

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:43.555
Even though we lost... it all ends
with these great feelings of pride...

00:18:43.555 --> 00:18:45.691
Even so, Wolf...

00:18:45.691 --> 00:18:50.185
Even in death... We'll never forgive you...

00:18:52.731 --> 00:18:56.568
Why?! Why is it this way?!

00:18:56.568 --> 00:18:59.435
After all I've done for you!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.205
Your funeral will be...

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:19.351
That's...!

00:19:28.033 --> 00:19:29.702
It appears it's all over.

00:19:29.702 --> 00:19:31.103
Xargin!

00:19:31.103 --> 00:19:32.438
Joseph.

00:19:32.438 --> 00:19:35.541
Once again, you've killed
those you attempted to protect,

00:19:35.541 --> 00:19:38.410
and made them victims
of your own powerlessness.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:42.815
And you'll only continue to waste
more lives doing what's pointless.

00:19:42.815 --> 00:19:45.784
Joseph, you are to blame for it all.

00:19:45.784 --> 00:19:48.687
Damn you!

